    <description><![CDATA[
## OmniEdge CLI

OmniEdge CLI is a command-line tool for creating secure, peer-to-peer mesh VPN connections for AI, robotics, and edge computing.

### Features

- **Peer-to-peer connections**: Direct device-to-device communication
- **Mesh networking**: Automatic network topology management
- **Cross-platform**: Works on Windows, macOS, and Linux
- **Secure**: Built on WireGuard protocol
- **Easy to use**: Simple CLI commands

### Usage

```powershell
# Login to your account
omniedge login

# Join a virtual network
omniedge join

# Check status
omniedge status
```

### Documentation

For more information, visit [https://connect.omniedge.io/docs](https://connect.omniedge.io/docs)
]]></description>
